  "goodToKnow": "Abreisen means to depart at the end of a stay: Wann reisen Sie ab? (when are you leaving?), a standard hotel question. Die Abreise is departure: am Abreisetag (on the day of departure), usually with check-out by 10 or 11 a.m. The opposite is anreisen (to arrive) and die Anreise. Verreisen means to go away on a trip: Wir verreisen im Sommer. Separable, with sein: ist abgereist."
